DESCRIPTION:Do you like to read? Do you want to build community? Do you wa
 nt to fight fascism? Join the Progressive Democrats of Buncombe for our re
 ading group\, meeting monthly on Mondays\, where we do all of this and hav
 e fun while doing it. This month\, we're reading “This Is the Plan: How 
 to End America's Meltdown and Save Democracy” by Ben Wikler. Who should 
 attend: All Democrats and left-leaning independents are welcome.
LOCATION:Archetype Brewing\, 265 Haywood Rd\, Asheville\, NC\, 28806
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/buncombedems/event/1028363/
X-SOURCE:Buncombe County Democratic Party
